- VERIFICATION: Reviewer reran on the exact tree: `swift build` clean, full `swift test` 110/110 (HEV suite 13/13 incl. 100-cycle), `swift test --sanitize=thread --filter HEVIntegrationTests` 13/13 with zero TSan reports (grep-verified), `swift format lint --strict` clean, `make check-core-boundaries check-native-dependencies` clean. Repeatability per prior evidence: implementer 30× full runs HEV 30/30, orchestrator 20× full runs 0 HEV failures.
